<title>BELGIUM: Bank Austria shares suspended in Brussels.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria shares suspended in Brussels.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels bourse said it had suspended trading in Bank Austria shares and certificates following a similar move by the Vienna bourse.</p>
<p>Trading in the stock would resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Vienna bourse said the suspension there was ahead of an important announcement. Earlier, the bank declined to comment on a newspaper report that it would offer 16 billion schillings ($1.5 billion) for rival Creditanstalt Bankverein, outdoing an existing bid.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
